# Line endings are NOT content (the hashText doctrine, applied to the checkout itself): every
# text file checks out LF on every OS, so "same tree" means the same BYTES on Linux, macOS and
# Windows — the precondition of "same working tree => same verdict" (first windows-latest leg,
# 2026-08-17: the runner's autocrlf turned scaffolded missions and golden fixtures CRLF, and
# byte-for-byte comparisons meant nothing across OS).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
